{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那口令就麻烦，嗯……」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0346", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为了不和濑名同学对上眼，\\n老师朝我使了使眼色。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": "为了不和濑名同学对上眼，老师朝我使了使眼色。", "plain_idx": 266, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学已经比之前好说话多了，\\n但是老师还是应付不来濑名同学啊。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": "濑名同学已经比之前好说话多了，但是老师还是应付不来濑名同学啊。", "plain_idx": 268, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也很想叫一次起立看看啊……", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「起立！！」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0219", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「敬礼！」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「各、各位辛苦了」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0347", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "老师慌慌张张地低下头。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "随后教室内便充斥着喧杂嘈乱的声音。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，不好意思。\\n　有一句话忘了说了……」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": "「啊，不好意思。　有一句话忘了说了……」", "plain_idx": 279, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0348", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个，大家——听我说」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0349", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "老师一脸困扰地看向我。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真是没办法。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「各位——」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": "「各位——」", "plain_idx": 285, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「老师还有注意事项要说，请大家保持安静」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5507", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不愧是濑名同学……", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明只是很平淡地说了出来，但是喧杂的教室还是立刻安静了下来。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": "明明只是很平淡地说了出来，但是喧杂的教室还是立刻安静了下来。", "plain_idx": 289, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个，马上就期末考试了，\\n　大家学习也不要落下哦」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": "「那个，马上就期末考试了，　大家学习也不要落下哦」", "plain_idx": 291, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0350", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「考试范围上课的时候已经说过了，\\n　要是还有不知道的人可以课后来问我」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": "「考试范围上课的时候已经说过了，　要是还有不知道的人可以课后来问我」", "plain_idx": 294, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0351", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「老师，还有别的事情吗？」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5508", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃、嗯。就这样，我说完了」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mc0352", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "万智老师逃跑似的离开了教室。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……还是老样子啊」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1128", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太来到我的座位旁边，看向刚刚从门口离开的老师。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「上课简单易懂又生动有趣，\\n　要是再稍微自信点就好了……」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": "「上课简单易懂又生动有趣，　要是再稍微自信点就好了……」", "plain_idx": 305, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊。然后说话的声音再大一点，\\n　让人能听清就帮大忙了」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": "「是啊。然后说话的声音再大一点，　让人能听清就帮大忙了」", "plain_idx": 307, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1129", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕竟性格就这样啊」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是这么说，濑名同学可能很适合做老师呢」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": "「要是这么说，濑名同学可能很适合做老师呢」", "plain_idx": 310, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1130", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为什么会那么想呢？」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5509", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学半开玩笑地问道。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说曹操曹操到啊。濑名同学你耳朵真灵啊」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1131", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太苦笑着。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「理由该不会是什么“我是校长女儿”之类的吧？」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": "「理由该不会是什么“我是校长女儿”之类的吧？」", "plain_idx": 318, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5510", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也许并不是没有关系」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你刚才不也是一句话就让周围安静下来了吗？」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": "「你刚才不也是一句话就让周围安静下来了吗？」", "plain_idx": 321, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1132", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是说还有注意事项的话，大家不就会听了吗？」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5511", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不好说啊……」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1133", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是吗。毕竟是期末考试相关的内容，\\n　没听到的话对自己也不利吧」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": "「是吗。毕竟是期末考试相关的内容，　没听到的话对自己也不利吧」", "plain_idx": 328, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5512", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总觉得眨眼间就到了这时候了呢」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不久前临时并校才刚刚开始，\\n　眨眼就已经期末考试了」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": "「不久前临时并校才刚刚开始，　眨眼就已经期末考试了」", "plain_idx": 332, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1134", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……就是说啊」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么回事，难得见你担心这事」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1135", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「难不成只顾着玩了？」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5513", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「倒不是那么回事。\\n　学习是有在学习，不过……」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": "「倒不是那么回事。　学习是有在学习，不过……」", "plain_idx": 340, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咕咕咕。唔哈哈哈哈」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn2186", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总算，总算是到了把瓜生的这副羊皮扒下来的时候了」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn2187", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「他这皮还能剥得下来吗？」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1136", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生的那副皮，\\n　不是都很牢固地、完美地黏在脸上吗？」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": "「瓜生的那副皮，　不是都很牢固地、完美地黏在脸上吗？」", "plain_idx": 349, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn2188", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，就让我来亲自出手将它剥下来！」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn2189", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你打算怎么做？」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「期末考试的时候就给我好好看着！\\n　这次考试我会用压倒性的实力，把你打的落花流水！」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": "「期末考试的时候就给我好好看着！　这次考试我会用压倒性的实力，把你打的落花流水！」", "plain_idx": 355, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn2190", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学气势汹汹地指着我。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": "乾同学气势汹汹地指着我。", "plain_idx": 357, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……下手请轻一点」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「别怕，我会全力以赴的你放心吧！」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn2191", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我就知道你会来这么一出」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，速速回家学习——\\n　啊，回家之前得先去找一趟美羽学姐！」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": "「好了，速速回家学习——　啊，回家之前得先去找一趟美羽学姐！」", "plain_idx": 363, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn2192", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「告辞！」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn2193", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学迈着开心的步子，跑了。", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……她到底想说些什么呀」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1137", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「应该是想说这次考试一起加油吧」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": "「应该是想说这次考试一起加油吧」", "plain_idx": 370, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「乾同学真是不坦率啊」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1138", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5514", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……说起来这次没来呢」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谁？」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5515", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我以为每次我们像这样聊天的时候，\\n　安洁都会冒个头的……」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": "「我以为每次我们像这样聊天的时候，　安洁都会冒个头的……」", "plain_idx": 379, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「听你这么一说……好像确实是呢。\\n　要是她也加入进来的话我还想像期中的时候一样\\n好好教她复习复习呢」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": "「听你这么一说……好像确实是呢。　要是她也加入进来的话我还想像期中的时候一样好好教她复习复习呢」", "plain_idx": 381, "len": 52, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5516", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁没来的理由，我大概隐隐约约察觉到一点了。", "text_idx": 384, "plain": "安洁没来的理由，我大概隐隐约约察觉到一点了。", "plain_idx": 384, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「先不说安洁了，这次怎么办？」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5517", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想自己先试着努力努力」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，那我们一起努力吧」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5518", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「前一个问题刚解决，马上就期末考试了么，\\n　也太会看时机了吧」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": "「前一个问题刚解决，马上就期末考试了么，　也太会看时机了吧」", "plain_idx": 391, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1139", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「时机？」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你们的二人时间都得用来复习了吧」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": "「你们的二人时间都得用来复习了吧」", "plain_idx": 394, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1140", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……还真是一点都不慌啊」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1141", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕竟也是没办法的事情」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「用我们自己的方式慢慢来就好」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……确实也许这样更好」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht1142", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3056", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃在教室里冒出了头。", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「马上」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3057", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁我想了想！」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3574", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「既然逃跑没什么用，\\n　那一开始就去自首不就好了吗？」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": "「既然逃跑没什么用，　那一开始就去自首不就好了吗？」", "plain_idx": 413, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3575", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「与其在考试的时候后悔，\\n　不如跨越此时的障碍，这样也许才不至于受致命伤」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": "「与其在考试的时候后悔，　不如跨越此时的障碍，这样也许才不至于受致命伤」", "plain_idx": 416, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3576", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不管走哪条路都会受伤？」", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3058", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是这个意思啊」", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5519", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。也就是说安洁也要来一起学习呢。\\n　来得好，欢迎欢迎」", "text_idx": 422, "plain": "「嗯。也就是说安洁也要来一起学习呢。　来得好，欢迎欢迎」", "plain_idx": 423, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，就让我一起学习吧」", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3577", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥，四个人该怎么学呢？」", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3059", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「女生很多，可以去樱乃的房间吗？」", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。我姑且是有收拾过」", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3060", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对不起，安洁突然来打扰……」", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3578", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家一起学的话没那么可怕」", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3061", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说的没错。\\n　现在必须得好好复习了」", "text_idx": 435, "plain": "「说的没错。　现在必须得好好复习了」", "plain_idx": 436, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3579", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「之前算是糊弄过去了。\\n　这次也一定有办法的！」", "text_idx": 438, "plain": "「之前算是糊弄过去了。　这次也一定有办法的！」", "plain_idx": 439, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3580", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没错。\\n　安洁的目标就是成为一个想做就能做到的女仆！」", "text_idx": 441, "plain": "「没错。　安洁的目标就是成为一个想做就能做到的女仆！」", "plain_idx": 442, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3581", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁像是为了表露决心将手攥紧拳头放在胸口。", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁，比起想做就能做到，\\n当个无论何时都能做到的女仆不应该更好吗？」", "text_idx": 445, "plain": "「安洁，比起想做就能做到，当个无论何时都能做到的女仆不应该更好吗？」", "plain_idx": 446, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5520", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为这个目前对我来说有点困难，\\n　所以得从做得到的事情开始！」", "text_idx": 448, "plain": "「因为这个目前对我来说有点困难，　所以得从做得到的事情开始！」", "plain_idx": 449, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3582", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么说呢？乐观，但又不是很乐观」", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……好啊。那让我们现在就开始吧」", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5521", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「多谢款待」", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「粗茶淡饭不成敬意」", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3583", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这里厨房好大真好啊」", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5522", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。可以容纳下三个人一起做饭，\\n　而且做饭也非常方便」", "text_idx": 459, "plain": "「是的。可以容纳下三个人一起做饭，　而且做饭也非常方便」", "plain_idx": 460, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3584", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。大家一起才最开心」", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3062", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为我之前只顾着吃了，\\n　后面收拾就让我来吧」", "text_idx": 464, "plain": "「因为我之前只顾着吃了，　后面收拾就让我来吧」", "plain_idx": 465, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「关于这点还请放心！\\n　已经差不多收拾完了」", "text_idx": 466, "plain": "「关于这点还请放心！　已经差不多收拾完了」", "plain_idx": 467, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3585", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只剩下盘子什么的了」", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5523", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……真厉害啊」", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为樱乃和爱理都有帮忙」", "text_idx": 472, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3586", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「待在这里，安洁作为女仆，\\n　总有种派不上用场的感觉」", "text_idx": 474, "plain": "「待在这里，安洁作为女仆，　总有种派不上用场的感觉」", "plain_idx": 475, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3587", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没那回事哦。\\n　毕竟安洁已经帮忙做了很多事了」", "text_idx": 477, "plain": "「没那回事哦。　毕竟安洁已经帮忙做了很多事了」", "plain_idx": 478, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "做饭和收拾，或许……还不止于此。", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总觉得，家里还莫名干净了不少，\\n　这也是安洁做的吧？」", "text_idx": 480, "plain": "「总觉得，家里还莫名干净了不少，　这也是安洁做的吧？」", "plain_idx": 481, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没错。我是尽量以不会被注意到的程度做的，\\n　结果还是被发现了吗，看来我的修行还是不足」", "text_idx": 482, "plain": "「没错。我是尽量以不会被注意到的程度做的，　结果还是被发现了吗，看来我的修行还是不足」", "plain_idx": 483, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3588", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我就说怎么时不时看不到你人，\\n　原来你都去做这种事情了呀？」", "text_idx": 485, "plain": "「我就说怎么时不时看不到你人，　原来你都去做这种事情了呀？」", "plain_idx": 486, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5524", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「学、学习的时候，\\n　我认为转换下心情是很有必要的，你们觉得呢？」", "text_idx": 488, "plain": "「学、学习的时候，　我认为转换下心情是很有必要的，你们觉得呢？」", "plain_idx": 489, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3589", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我懂我懂。考试期间，房间干干净净的」", "text_idx": 491, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3063", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真好啊。我也能理解那种心情，\\n　今天的学习目标也达成了」", "text_idx": 493, "plain": "「真好啊。我也能理解那种心情，　今天的学习目标也达成了」", "plain_idx": 494, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5525", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明天怎么办呢？」", "text_idx": 496, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3064", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉，明天我可能稍微有点事情，\\n　等到明天再看吧？」", "text_idx": 498, "plain": "「抱歉，明天我可能稍微有点事情，　等到明天再看吧？」", "plain_idx": 499, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar5526", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，好」", "text_idx": 501, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3065", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁呢？」", "text_idx": 503, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁和爱理一起」", "text_idx": 504, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3590", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样啊？」", "text_idx": 506, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。我不打算打扰你们的二人世界」", "text_idx": 507, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3591", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁来回看着我们两个人，笑了起来。", "text_idx": 509, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
